# Pricing Overview

## Rate Structure
Three-tier delivery model with location-based adjustments:
- **Onshore**: US-based, on-site/hybrid ($800-$2,400/day)
- **Nearshore**: Mexico/Canada, same timezone, bilingual ($520-$1,560/day)
- **Offshore**: India/Philippines/Poland, overnight delivery ($360-$1,080/day)

## Key Rate Categories
| Category | Range (Onshore) | Typical Use |
|----------|-----------------|-------------|
| Executive | $1,800-$2,400 | Program oversight, steering committees |
| Architecture | $1,550-$1,800 | Solution design, technical authority |
| Senior Consultant | $1,400-$1,500 | Implementation leadership, specialty roles |
| Consultant | $1,000-$1,100 | Development, configuration, testing |
| Analyst / QA | $800-$900 | Data migration, quality assurance |
| DevOps / Data Engineer | $1,050-$1,250 | Automation, pipelines, infrastructure |

## Specialty Premium Roles
- Oracle Cloud Specialist: $1,500/day (onshore)
- SAP Functional Lead: $1,450/day
- Change Management Lead: $1,300/day
- Security Architect: $1,700/day

## Commercial Terms
- Rates per 8-hour day, expenses excluded
- Volume discount: engagements >$500K
- Rate holds: 12 months from effective date
- Rate card version: v2026.1 (effective Jan 2026)
